00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:35.000
Wishing you could be there live for the big game, soaking up the atmosphere in a crowd. But too often, life gets busy or the price hold you back. Price line is here to help you make it happen. With millions of deals on flights, hotels, and rental cars, you can go see the game live. Don't just dream about the trip. Book it with Priceline. Download the Priceline app or visit Priceline.com.

